   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Kèo prépare son anniversaire.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແກ້ວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ວັນເກີດຂອງຂ້ອຍແມ່ນວັນເສົາໜ້າ</span><span class=\"rom\">Wán-kɤ̏ɤt khɔ̌ɔng khɔ̂ɔy mɛ̄ɛn wán-sǎo nâa.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ວັນທີເທົ່າໃດ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Wán-thíi thāo-dǎy?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແກ້ວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ວັນທີສິບຫ້າ</span><span class=\"rom\">Wán-thíi sīp hâa.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເຈົ້າຈະອາຍຸຈັກປີ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Jâo já ǎa-nyū ják pǐi?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແກ້ວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ສິບແປດປີ!</span><span class=\"rom\">Sīp pɛ̏ɛt pǐi!</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ສຸກສັນວັນເກີດລ່ວງໜ້າ!</span><span class=\"rom\">Sūk-sǎn wán-kɤ̏ɤt lūang-nâa!</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Kèo</b> — Mon anniversaire, c&#x27;est samedi prochain.<br><b>Clara</b> — Le combien ?<br><b>Kèo</b> — Le quinze.<br><b>Clara</b> — Tu vas avoir quel âge ?<br><b>Kèo</b> — Dix-huit ans !<br><b>Clara</b> — Joyeux anniversaire en avance !</p></details>"
